\f1\fs22 Before dusk, Hayley and Kathy went down to the lookout and stood at the railing, holding hands and enjoying the view. Not long after, but long enough after that it could plausibly be coincidence, Sarah went for a jog, and found the pair quite by accident. She was warmly greeted and then the Three Sisters put their arms about each other and regarded their ancient rock namesakes across the valley. Hayley was briefly afraid she was the dumpy one.\
