\f1\fs22 They huddled and kept their voices low, allowing their words to be carried over the cliff. Hayley warned even the lookout would be monitored, Kathy doubted it, and Sarah opted for caution.\
Hayley let the quiet run out to whatever length it wanted. Also, Kathy was licking her earlobe.\
\'93I want you to look into Eloise,\'94 Sarah said to Hayley, barely above a whisper.\
Hayley did not move at all. \'93I\'92m her Chief Security Officer.\'94\
\'93I\'92m her daughter-in-law and I am never sure the extent to which she is playing me.\'94\
Hayley leaned forward so she could see past Kathy and meet Sarah\'92s eyes.\
\'93What I mean is, I\'92m her Chief Security Officer so, of course, I\'92m looking into her.\'94\
\'93That\'92s my girl,\'94 Kathy said and licked Hayley\'92s ear again.\
Sarah squeezed Kathy\'92s butt, for the sake of any cameras. She had to concede that Kathy\'92s butt was firm and squeezable.\
\'93Sometimes,\'94 Hayley said, \'93I\'92m not sure who is running this project\'97you, or the Sages. They\'92ve been in everything since the start.\'94\
Sarah shot Hayley a hot look, but she knew she had a point. \'93That\'92s why I want them close.\'94 She paused. \'93Besides, Kleo has been kind to me.\'94\
\'93It\'92s not Kleo you should worry about,\'94 Kathy said. \'93It\'92s Chilo.\'94\
\'93I\'92m not sure,\'94 Hayley said. \'93He plays the looser cannon, but I suspect Kleo is the fuse-lighter.\'94\
Hayley was quiet for a moment. Then she said, \'93Stockwell\'92s private security was dead before he had finished installing it on any device here. Eloise knew what he had done with his signing bonus before he had finished browsing his product catalogues.\'94\
Sarah smiled. Hayley was already on the case. But Eloise had probably already anticipated that. Eight months ago, Sarah would have been running the cybersecurity herself, and she would not have told anyone either.\
\'93So far,\'94 Hayley said, \'93I\'92ve uncovered no evidence that Eloise is running an alternative Gyges disc project.\'94\
\'93Keep looking,\'94 Sarah said. \'93There could be plans for another, or plans to convert Project Kebab to weapons research once it\'92s passed enough gates.\'94\
\'93What about the extra discs the Sages want?\'94 Hayley asked.\
Sarah watched the sun setting over sandstone. \'93That\'92s the thing. So far, she\'92s been reluctant to just go out and get more. She fought hard to retrieve the first one she had taken, then the Sages gifted Johnny a second one.\'94\
\'93I doubt she\'92ll just give up on the project now,\'94 Kathy said.\
\'93Unless all of this is about securing an heir after all.\'94\
None of the Three Sisters believed that, especially the three standing in sunset silhouette across the valley.
